[COMMENTS]
STATION,Velocity area station gauging a natural mountainous catchment on South Uist (Outer Hebrides). GENERAL: Open channel section 7m wide with gravel control. Station added to peak flows dataset in October 2018 (WINFAP Files v7). STATION HYDROMETRY: No cableway. Gauged to around QMED. One peak flow rating across period of record.
CATCHMENT,A natural mountainous catchment on North Uist with little storage. Mainly rough grazing, peat bog and moorland with some forestry.
Qmed Suitability,Gauged up to around QMED.
Pooling Suitability,Not gauged sufficiently above QMED to a sufficient stage to have some confidence in the AMAX 3 event being within 30% of the true value.
[END]
